  "text": "<h2 id=\"Personal_life\">Personal life</h2>\n<h2 id=\"Early_career\">Early career</h2>\n<h2 id=\"Partnership_with_Savchenko\">Partnership with Savchenko</h2>\n<h3 id=\"2005–06_season\"><span id=\"2005.E2.80.9306_season\"></span>2005–06 season</h3>\n<h3 id=\"2006–07_season\"><span id=\"2006.E2.80.9307_season\"></span>2006–07 season</h3>\n<h3 id=\"2007–08_season\"><span id=\"2007.E2.80.9308_season\"></span>2007–08 season</h3>\n<h3 id=\"2008–09_season\"><span id=\"2008.E2.80.9309_season\"></span>2008–09 season</h3>\n<h3 id=\"2009–10_season\"><span id=\"2009.E2.80.9310_season\"></span>2009–10 season</h3>\n<h3 id=\"2010–11_season\"><span id=\"2010.E2.80.9311_season\"></span>2010–11 season</h3>\n<h3 id=\"2011–12_season\"><span id=\"2011.E2.80.9312_season\"></span>2011–12 season</h3>\n<h3 id=\"2012–13_season\"><span id=\"2012.E2.80.9313_season\"></span>2012–13 season</h3>\n<h3 id=\"2013–14_season\"><span id=\"2013.E2.80.9314_season\"></span>2013–14 season</h3>\n<h2 id=\"Post-competitive_career\">Post-competitive career</h2>\n<h2 id=\"Programs\">Programs</h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"text-align: center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Season\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Short_program_(figure_skating)\" title=\"Short program (figure skating)\">Short program</a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Free_skating\" title=\"Free skating\">Free skating</a>\n</th>\n<th>Exhibition\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>2013–2014 <br/><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-ISU-1314b_90-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ISU-1314b-90\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>90<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-ISU-1314a_91-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ISU-1314a-91\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>91<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</th>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Pink_Panther_(2006_film)\" title=\"The Pink Panther (2006 film)\">The Pink Panther</a> <br/><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\"> by <a href=\"/wiki/Christophe_Beck\" title=\"Chris