title=\"Justin Timberlake\">Justin Timberlake</a> </span></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>2012–2013 <br/><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-ISU-1213_92-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ISU-1213-92\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>92<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</th>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Kismet <br/><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\"> by <a href=\"/wiki/Bond_(string_quartet)\" title=\"Bond (string quartet)\">Bond</a> <br/> choreo. by Ingo Steuer </span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Flamenco Bolero <br/><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\"> by Gustavo Montesano <br/> choreo. by Ingo Steuer </span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Nella_Fantasia\" title=\"Nella Fantasia\">Nella Fantasia</a><br/><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\">by <a href=\"/wiki/Il_Divo\" title=\"Il Divo\">Il Divo</a><br/>choreographed by <a href=\"/wiki/Ingo_Steuer\" title=\"Ingo Steuer\">Ingo Steuer</a></span></li></ul>\n<hr/>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Happy_(Leona_Lewis_song)\" title=\"Happy (Leona Lewis song)\">Happy</a> <br/><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\"> by <a href=\"/wiki/Leona_Lewis\" title=\"Leona Lewis\">Leona Lewis</a> <br/> choreo. by Ingo Steuer </span></li></ul>\n<hr/>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Pink_Panther_(2006_film)\" title=\"The Pink Panther (2006 film)\">The Pink Panther</a> <br/><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\"> by <a href=\"/wiki/Christophe_Beck\" title=\"Christophe Beck\">Christophe Beck</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Henry_Mancini\" title=\"Henry Mancini\">Henry Mancini</a> <br/> choreo. by Ingo Steuer </span></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>2011–2012 <br/><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-GS111215_42-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-GS111215-42\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>42<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-ISU-1112_93-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ISU-1112-93\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>93<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_re