\"#cite_note-IFS110119-28\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>28<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-ISU-1011_96-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ISU-1011-96\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>96<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</th>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Korobeiniki\" title=\"Korobeiniki\">Korobushka</a> <br/><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\"> performed by <a href=\"/wiki/Bond_(string_quartet)\" title=\"Bond (string quartet)\">Bond</a> <br/> choreo. by Ingo Steuer </span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Pink_Panther_(2006_film)\" title=\"The Pink Panther (2006 film)\">The Pink Panther</a> <br/><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\"> by <a href=\"/wiki/Christophe_Beck\" title=\"Christophe Beck\">Christophe Beck</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Henry_Mancini\" title=\"Henry Mancini\">Henry Mancini</a> <br/> choreo. by Ingo Steuer </span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/You%27ll_Never_Be_Alone\" title=\"You'll Never Be Alone\">You'll Never Be Alone</a> <br/><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\"> by <a href=\"/wiki/Anastacia\" title=\"Anastacia\">Anastacia</a> <br/> choreo. by Ingo Steuer </span></li></ul>\n<hr/>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Barbie_Girl\" title=\"Barbie Girl\">Barbie Girl</a> <br/><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\"> by <a href=\"/wiki/Aqua_(band)\" title=\"Aqua (band)\">Aqua</a> <br/> choreo. by Ingo Steuer </span></li></ul>\n<hr/>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Gee_(Girls%27_Generation_song)\" title=\"Gee (Girls' Generation song)\">Gee</a> <br/><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\"> by <a href=\"/wiki/Girls%27_Generation\" title=\"Girls' Generation\">Girls' Generation</a> <br/> choreo. by Ingo Steuer </span></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>2009–2010 <br/><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-GS091124_23-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-GS091124-23\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>23<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-ISU-0910b_97-0\"><a hre