er_song)\" title=\"Bad Day (Daniel Powter song)\">Bad Day</a> <br/><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\"> by <a href=\"/wiki/Daniel_Powter\" title=\"Daniel Powter\">Daniel Powter</a> <br/> choreo. by Ingo Steuer </span></li></ul>\n<hr/>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Leningrad_(song)\" title=\"Leningrad (song)\">Leningrad</a> <br/><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\"> by <a href=\"/wiki/Chris_de_Burgh\" title=\"Chris de Burgh\">Chris de Burgh</a> <br/> choreo. by Ingo Steuer </span></li></ul>\n<hr/>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Fascination_(Alphabeat_song)\" title=\"Fascination (Alphabeat song)\">Fascination</a> <br/><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\"> by <a href=\"/wiki/Alphabeat\" title=\"Alphabeat\">Alphabeat</a> <br/> choreo. by Ingo Steuer </span></li></ul>\n<hr/>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Send_In_the_Clowns\" title=\"Send In the Clowns\">Send In the Clowns</a> <br/><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\"> (from <a href=\"/wiki/A_Little_Night_Music\" title=\"A Little Night Music\">A Little Night Music</a>) <br/> by <a href=\"/wiki/Stephen_Sondheim\" title=\"Stephen Sondheim\">Stephen Sondheim</a> <br/> performed by <a href=\"/wiki/Danny_Wright_(pianist)\" title=\"Danny Wright (pianist)\">Danny Wright</a> <br/> choreo. by Ingo Steuer </span></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>2008–2009 <br/><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-ISU-0809_99-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ISU-0809-99\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>99<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</th>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Lost_in_Space_(Apollo_440_song)\" title=\"Lost in Space (Apollo 440 song)\">Lost in Space</a> <br/><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\"> by <a href=\"/wiki/Apollo_440\" title=\"Apollo 440\">Apollo 440</a> <br/> choreo. by Ingo Steuer </span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Schindler%27s_List\" title=\"Schindler's List\">Schindler's List</a> <br/><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\"> by <a href=\"/wiki/John_Williams\" title=\"John Williams\">John Williams</a> </span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/A