la Fantasia</a><br/><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\">by <a href=\"/wiki/Il_Divo\" title=\"Il Divo\">Il Divo</a><br/>choreographed by <a href=\"/wiki/Ingo_Steuer\" title=\"Ingo Steuer\">Ingo Steuer</a></span></li></ul>\n<hr/>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Titanic_(1997_film)\" title=\"Titanic (1997 film)\">Titanic</a><br/><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\"> by <a href=\"/wiki/James_Horner\" title=\"James Horner\">James Horner</a> <br/> choreo. by Ingo Steuer </span></li></ul>\n<hr/>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Feeling_Good#Michael_Bublé\" title=\"Feeling Good\">Feeling Good</a><br/><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\">by <a href=\"/wiki/Michael_Bubl%C3%A9\" title=\"Michael Bublé\">Michael Bublé</a> <br/> choreo. by Ingo Steuer </span></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>2006–2007 <br/><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-ISU-0607_101-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ISU-0607-101\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>101<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</th>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Once_Upon_a_Time_in_Mexico\" title=\"Once Upon a Time in Mexico\">Once Upon a Time in Mexico</a> <br/><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\"> (2003 film) <br/> by <a href=\"/wiki/Brian_Setzer\" title=\"Brian Setzer\">Brian Setzer</a> <br/> choreo. by Ingo Steuer </span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Mission_(soundtrack)\" title=\"The Mission (soundtrack)\">The Mission</a> <br/><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\"> by <a href=\"/wiki/Ennio_Morricone\" title=\"Ennio Morricone\">Ennio Morricone</a> <br/> choreo. by Ingo Steuer </span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Feeling Good <br/><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\"> by Michael Bublé <br/> choreo. by Ingo Steuer </span></li></ul>\n<hr/>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Somewhere_(song)\" title=\"Somewhere (song)\">Somewhere</a> <br/><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\"> (from <a href=\"/wiki/West_Side_Story_(1961_soundtrack)\" title=\"West Side Story (1961 soundtrack)\">West Side Story</a>) <br/> by <a href=\"/wiki/Stephen_Sondheim\" title=\"Stephen